'''Satanmaria''' (サタンマリア) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Satanmaria
|image = E 453.png
|appearance = [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
Satanmaria is quite frankly not that powerful. She has a low DPS of 1,562, so just spam meatshields along with damage dealers and you should kill her easily. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] completely demolishes this enemy, and is a prime pick when fighting against her.

